# CLI patterns (`satmap_dataset/cli/`)

Package layout: `app.py` (Typer app), `common.py` / `config_builders.py` (shared helpers),
`registry.py` (`StageCommandSpec` for repeated flavors), `layers_*.py` / `commands_*.py`.

## Three flavors per stage

1. Flag form (`index`, `download`, …) — hand-written in the layer module
2. JSON form (`index-json`, …) — 1:1 onto Pydantic config
3. Base+location form (`*-location-json`, `*-all-location-json`) — merge `base.json` + location JSON

## Adding a new stage/layer command set

Prefer a `StageCommandSpec` in `register()` over copying json/location/all handlers.
Keep unique flag forms and special batch behavior (e.g. `run-all-location-json` skip) hand-written.
Dispatch to stage `run()` via **call-time** lookup (`lambda c: dem.run(c)`) so tests can monkeypatch.

## Location paths

`_apply_location_paths_policy` derives `downloads_<slug>`, `rendered_<slug>`, `artifacts_<slug>` from `location_name`.

## Tests

CLI merge/build helpers are heavily tested in `tests/test_cli_json_params.py`. Run targeted pytest after CLI changes.
Public imports stay on `satmap_dataset.cli` (`app`, builders, pipeline module aliases).
